"entity": {
"name": "Align Technology, Inc.",
"description": "Align Technology, Inc. is a medical device company, which engages in the design, manufacture, and market of orthodontics, restorative, and aesthetic dentistry products. It operates through the following segments: Clear Aligner and Systems and Services. The Clear Aligner segment consists of invisalign full, teen, and assist products, and Vivera retainers. The Systems and Services segment includes sales related to iTero intraoral scanning systems, subscription software, disposables, pay per scan services, and exocad CAD/CAM software. The company was founded in March 1997 and is headquartered in Tempe, AZ.",
